+- **SECURITY**, **BREAKING**: Remove `forge.util.parseUrl()` (and
+  `forge.http.parseUrl` alias) and use the [WHATWG URL
+  Standard](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/). `URL` is supported by modern browers
